# T21 spot check B23 on Backyard Bash (the original case): the car drifts left off the grid and
# drives nose-first into the deck face west of the ramp, then looks back (expected: the look-back
# boom swings up and looks down at the car instead of filling the view with deck boards).
# Two attempts with different steering (Restart between). Gamepad for analog steering.
wait ui
wait screen title
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
wait screen main
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen trackSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Sofa Circuit
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Backyard Bash
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # select → Choose car
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # → Car select
wait screen carSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
wait racing
hold gamepad throttle 1
hold gamepad steer -0.35
@40 hold gamepad steer 0
@240 shot d23_a_01_chase_4s
@360 shot d23_a_02_chase_6s
@380 hold gamepad lookBack 1
@420 shot d23_a_03_look_back_7s
@440 hold gamepad lookBack 0
@460 release gamepad
0.2 tap keyboardA pause
wait screen pause
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Restart
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait countdown
wait racing
hold gamepad throttle 1
hold gamepad steer -0.2
@60 hold gamepad steer 0
@240 shot d23_b_01_chase_4s
@360 shot d23_b_02_chase_6s
@380 hold gamepad lookBack 1
@420 shot d23_b_03_look_back_7s
@440 release gamepad
1.0 exit
